      "observations": [
        "The full eight-file patch adds an externally based Mork parser, packages it as an ES module, registers a fixture test and exposes a diagnostic trigger in folder properties. The listener uses the actual folder summaryFile.path and URI. Normal click passes prettify=true; Shift passes false. The original dump method reads bytes, parses a flat row list, optionally keeps rows with message-id and maps known fields, writes JSON to the native console, then resolves with that selected data.",
